<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Sam Yang buys 16,000T of U.S. soybeans.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Sam Yang buys 16,000T of U.S. soybeans.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Sam Yang Foods Co Ltd said on Thursday it bought 16,000 tonnes of U.S. No 2 soybean at basis over November futures on the Chicago Board of Trade.</p>
</text>
